item.description:
Life Changingly Good TED Radio Hour: &ldquo;The Source of Creativity&rdquo; Basic summary: &ldquo;everyone is and can be creative: you just have to be fearless about failing, and practice a bunch.&rdquo;
Being creative is a skill, available to everyone.
This has huge implications for how we raise our kids. Instead of telling them they&rsquo;re &ldquo;not creative,&rdquo; we should encourage them to experiment, fail, and try again.
